    "1️⃣ FIRST CONDITIONAL NIMA?\n\nFirst Conditional — real va mumkin bo'lgan vaziyatlarni ifodalaydi. Agar biror narsa bo'lsa, boshqa narsa bo'ladi.\n\nIf + Present Simple, will + V1\n  If it rains, I will stay home. (Agar yomg'ir yog'sa, uyda qolaman)\n  If you study, you will pass the exam. (Agar o'qisang, imtihondan o'tasan)\n  If she comes, we will be happy. (Agar kelsa, biz baxtli bo'lamiz)\n\n📌 If dan keyin DOIM Present Simple (will KELMAYDI!):\n  ❌ If it will rain, I will stay. (NOTO'G'RI)\n  ✅ If it rains, I will stay. (TO'G'RI)",
    "2️⃣ IF VA QISM TARTIBI\n\nIkki xil tartib bo'lishi mumkin:\n\n1. If + condition, result:\n  If you study, you will pass.\n  (vergul bilan ajratiladi)\n\n2. Result + if + condition:\n  You will pass if you study.\n  (vergul KERAK EMAS)\n\n🔴 QOIDA: If li qismda doim Present Simple, natija qismida will + V1!\n  If he calls me, I will tell him.\n  I will tell him if he calls me.",
    "3️⃣ NEGATIVE (INKOR)\n\nIf qismida inkor (don't/doesn't):\n  If you don't study, you will fail.\n  If she doesn't come, we will be sad.\n\nNatija qismida inkor (won't):\n  If you study, you won't fail.\n  If you hurry, you won't be late.\n\nIkkala qismida inkor:\n  If you don't hurry, you won't catch the bus.\n  If she doesn't call, I won't go.",
    "4️⃣ QUESTIONS (SAVOLLAR)\n\nNatija qismini savolga aylantirish:\n  Will you go if it rains?\n  Will she pass if she studies?\n  What will you do if you miss the bus?\n  Where will you go if you have time?\n\n🔴 QOIDA: if qismi hech qachon savolga aylanmaydi. Faqat natija qismi savol bo'ladi!\n  Will + subject + V1 + if + Present Simple?",
    "5️⃣ IF VA UNLESS (agar...masa)\n\nUnless = if not:\n  Unless you study, you will fail. (Agar o'qimasang, yiqilasan)\n  I won't go unless she invites me. (Agar u meni taklif qilmasa, bormayman)\n\n  Unless you hurry, you will miss the bus.\n  = If you don't hurry, you will miss the bus.\n\n🔴 MUHIM: Unless dan keyin INKOR ISHLATILMAYDI!\n  ❌ Unless you don't study (NOTO'G'RI)\n  ✅ Unless you study (TO'G'RI — 'if you don't study' ma'nosida)",
